{"id":"begegnung","lemma":"Begegnung","pos":"noun","rank":3733,"glosses":["encounter, meeting","match"],"ipa":"/bəˈɡeːɡnʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/10/De-Begegnung.ogg/De-Begegnung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Begegnung","plural":"Begegnungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Das war unsere erste Begegnung.","en":"That was our first encounter.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},{"g":"first"},null]},{"text":"Es war eine zufällige Begegnung.","en":"It was a casual meeting.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"accidentally","l":"zufällig"},null]},{"text":"Kannst du dich noch an unsere erste Begegnung erinnern?","en":"Can you still remember when we first met?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},{"g":"first"},null,{"g":"to remind"}]},{"text":"Ich kann die Begegnung mit dir kaum erwarten!","en":"I can't wait to see you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"barely, hardly"},{"g":"to expect"}]},{"text":"Es ist viel Wasser ins Meer geflossen seit unserer letzten Begegnung.","en":"It's been ages since we last met.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"much, a lot"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"into the"},{"g":"sea"},{"g":"to flow","l":"fließen"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},{"g":"the last one","l":"Letzter"},null]}]}